1. User opens the Comic Craft application.


2. User enters a story idea or topic.


3. The application sends the input to the Gemini model.


4. Gemini generates the story, characters, scenes, and dialogues.


5. The story is divided into comic panels.


6. The generated content is displayed to the user.


7. User can review and modify the comic story.


8. The final comic story can be saved or shared.
